Nexus GPT Live (nexus/live) re-implements an undocumented realtime voice-call
protocol from observed behaviour recorded in
plans/in-progress/GPT_LIVE_PROTOCOL_NOTES.md. The endpoints, headers, event
names and message shapes are pinned to two MIT-licensed reference
integrations:

  malhashemi/opencode-gpt-live, commit c23101cfdeb3feaf03f09aa678135ca01d72ed4e
  Copyright (c) 2026 M. Adel Alhashemi

  can1357/oh-my-pi, commit 818dd42b73ab1caad17fa06d4edcc3a97086dc57
  Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner; (c) 2025-2026 Can Bölük; (c) 2026 Stencil Labs, Inc.

No code or prompt text was copied from either project; the bundled voice
instructions are written independently. Neither project was run while writing
this module, and nothing here has been exercised against the real service.

This is an experimental client for a private endpoint and may stop working
without notice. ChatGPT and GPT-Live are OpenAI trademarks; Nexus is not
affiliated with OpenAI.
